  "conformsTo": "http://mlcommons.org/croissant/1.1",
  "name": "osm-polygon-website-tag",
  "description": "\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tOSM Polygon Website Dataset\n\t\n\n\nOpenStreetMap closed ways and polygon relations carrying a non-empty website OR contact:website tag, with full main-page text extracted using Trafilatura. Every statistic below is regenerated from the current upload-acknowledged Parquet artifacts.\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tSnapshot\n\t\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\nMetric\nValue\nWhat it means\n\n\n\t\t\nSnapshot status\nDone\nCurrent published snapshot\n\n\nRegional PBFs included\n386 / 386\nPublished source shards / expected source PBFs\n\n\nPublished\u2026 See the full description on the dataset page: https://huggingface.co/datasets/NoeFlandre/osm-polygon-website-tag.",
  "alternateName": [
    "NoeFlandre/osm-polygon-website-tag"
  ],
  "creator": {
